#: tips.cc:3
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"<p>On KPhotoAlbum's home page (http://www.kphotoalbum.org/) you may see a few "
"videos featuring a number of\n"
"different KPhotoAlbum features.</p>\n"
msgstr ""
"<p>Na páxina web de KimDaBa (http://ktown.kde.org/kimdaba/) poderá ver uns "
"vídeos de demostrazón de várias características\n"
"do programa.</p>\n"

#: tips.cc:9
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"<p>It is possible to create new categories - that are alternatives\n"
"to <b>Person</b>, <b>Location</b>, and <b>Keywords</b> - in the image\n"
"property page. Simply go to the <b>Settings->Configure KPhotoAlbum</b> "
"dialog to add your own, or\n"
"delete one of the existing ones.</p>\n"
msgstr ""
"<p>É posíbel criar novas categorias, isto é, alternativas a\n"
"<b>Persoa</b>, <b>Lugar</b> e <b>Palabras-chave</b>, na páxina de\n"
"propriedades das imaxes. Abonda con ir ao diálogo <tt>Configurazón->"
"Configurar KimDaBa</tt>\n"
"para engadir os seus próprios ou eliminar os que xa existen.</p>\n"

#: tips.cc:17
msgid ""
"<p>You may rename or delete a person, location, keyword or similar by\n"
"right-clicking on the item in the image property dialog.</p>\n"
msgstr ""
"<p>Pode renomear ou borrar unha persoa, lugar, palabra-chave ou\n"
"semellante premendo o botón direito no ítem no diálogo de propriedades da "
"imaxe.</p>\n"

#: tips.cc:23
msgid ""
"<p>When generating HTML you must specify a base directory for\n"
"the images. Here you can specify any <a\n"
"href=\"help:/kioslave/index.html\">protocol</a> supported by KDE, like ftp or\n"
"fish.</p>\n"
"<p>Examples:\n"
"<ul>\n"
"  "
"<li> ftp://someserver/my-upload-area/images (upload using FTP)\n"
"  "
"<li> fish://someserver/home/foo/images (upload using ssh)\n"
"  "
"<li> smb://someserver/c/images (upload to a Windows share)\n"
"</ul>\n"
"</p>\n"
msgstr ""
"<p>Ao xerar HTML debe indicar un Directório base para\n"
"as imaxes. Aqui pode especificar calquer <a\n"
"href=\"help:/kioslave/index.html\">protocolo</a> coñecido por KDE, como ftp ou\n"
"fish.</p>\n"
"<p>Exemplos:\n"
"<ul>\n"
"  "
"<li> ftp://unservidor/a-miña-área-de-subidas/imaxes (subir usando FTP)\n"
"  "
"<li> fish://unservidor/home/foo/imaxes (subir usando ssh)\n"
"  "
"<li> smb:/unservidor/c/imaxes (subir a un Directório compartido de Windows)\n"
"</ul>\n"
"</p>\n"

#: tips.cc:38
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"<p>When you bring new images to your collection, you might not have time\n"
"right away to categorize them (i.e. specify People, Places,\n"
"etc.). Therefore, you might later want to find those images which have not\n"
"yet been categorized. Here is what I do.</p> \n"
"<p>I use the <b>keyword</b> <b>OK</b>, which I set on images, once I've\n"
"categorized them (i.e. just like you may have a keyword for <b>Summer\n"
"Party</b> or <b>Interrail trip 1990</b>, you now have a keyword\n"
"<b>OK</b>). To find uncategorized images, I choose the\n"
"<b>Search</b> item from the browser, and in the keywords field, I\n"
"type <b>!OK</b>. This will find all images which do <b>not</b> have the\n"
"<b>OK</b> item.\n"
msgstr ""
"<p>Ao traer novas imaxes para a coleczón pode que non dispoña de tempo\n"
"imediatamente para catalogá-las (isto é, especificar Persoas, Lugares,\n"
"etc.). Polo tanto, talvez queira máis tarde atopar esas imaxes que ainda non\n"
"se catalogaron. Isto é o que ha de facer:</p>\n"
"<p>Eu uso o <tt>teclado</tt> <tt>OK</tt>, que poño sobre imaxes, unha vez que "
"as\n"
"cataloguei (ou sexa, igual que pode ter unha palabra chave para <tt>Festa do\n"
"Verán</tt> ou <tt>Viaxe en Interrail 1990</tt>, agora ten unha palabra-chave\n"
"<tt>OK</tt>). para atopar as imaxes que non están catalogadas, escollo o\n"
"elemento <tt>Procurar</tt> do navegador e na liña de palabras-chave modifico,\\ "
"edito<tt>!OK</tt>. Isto atopará todas as imaxes que <b>non</b>teñen o\n"
"elemento <tt>OK</tt>.\n"

#: tips.cc:53
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"<p>You can reorder images on your hard disk after having loaded them into\n"
"KPhotoAlbum - KPhotoAlbum will still remember them, as it calculates checksums "
"for\n"
"the images.</p>\n"
msgstr ""
"<p>Pode reordenar as imaxes do disco duro logo de té-las carregadas en\n"
"KimDaBa - KimDaBa recordará-as, xa que calcula as checksums\n"
"das imaxes.</p>\n"

#: tips.cc:60
msgid ""
"<p>If you like KPhotoAlbum, and it adds value to your daily life, please\n"
"consider donating money to the KPhotoAlbum developer as a courtesy. See\n"
"http://www.kphotoalbum.org/support.htm.\n"
"</p>\n"
msgstr ""

#: tips.cc:68
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"<p>It's possible to associate images with categories. That way when browsing, "
"say people, you\n"
"may get a small icon for each person with e.g. the person's face.</p>\n"
"<p>To specify an icon for a person, load the person in the viewer, zoom to\n"
"the part which you want to make into an icon, and choose\n"
"<b>Show Category Editor</b>. This will bring up a dialog where you can\n"
"find the person, and set the image.\n"
"</p>\n"
msgstr ""
"<p>É posíbel asociar imaxes con\n"
"persoas/lugares/palabras-chave/etc. Deste xeito, ao navegar por,\n"
"por exemplo, as persoas,\n"
"pode-se ter unha ícone pequena para cada persoa con, por exemplo,\n"
"a cara da persoa.</p>\n"
"<p>Para especificar unha ícone para unha persoa, carregue a persoa no\n"
"navegador, achegue-se á parte que quer converter en ícone e escolla\n"
"<tt>Mostrar o Editor de Categorias</tt> Isto fará que apareza un diálogo\n"
"no que pode atopar a persoa e seleccionar a imaxe.</p>\n"

#: tips.cc:79
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"<p>You may close the image annotation dialog (the one where you specify\n"
"people, places, etc. for the images) by pressing Ctrl+Enter.\n"
"</p>\n"
msgstr ""
"<p>Pode pechar o diálogo de configurazón de imaxes premendo en Ctrl+Enter.\n"
"</p>\n"

#: tips.cc:86
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"<p>KPhotoAlbum has an mailing list at\n"
"http://klaralvdalens-datakonsult.se/mailman/listinfo/kphotoalbum, and an IRC\n"
"channel named <b>#kphotoalbum</b> on <b>irc.kde.org</b>.</p>\n"
msgstr ""
"<p>KimDaBa ten unha lista de correo en\n"
"http://klaralvdalens-datakonsult.se/mailman/listinfo/kimdaba\n"
"e un canal de IRC chamado <tt>#kimdaba</tt> en <tt>irc.kde.org</tt></p>\n"

#: tips.cc:93
msgid ""
"<p>You may reorder images by dragging and dropping one image onto\n"
"another. If you drop it on the left edge, it will end up in front of\n"
"the other, if you drop it on the right edge it will be inserted behind.</p>\n"
"<p align=\"right\">-- Tip contributed by Eivind Kjorstad</p>\n"
msgstr ""
"<p>Pode reorganizar as imaxes arrastando e soltando unha imaxe sobre\n"
"outra. Se solta unha na parte esquerda acabará diante\n"
"da outra; se a solta sobre a parte direita inserirá-se a continuazón.</p>\n"
"<p align=\"right\">-- Suxestión fornecida por Eivind Kjorstad</p>\n"

#: tips.cc:101
msgid ""
"<p>\n"
"On the thumbnail view, you can resize the grid to your needs just by clicking \n"
"the middle mouse button and dragging around. On most systems you can emulate \n"
"the middle mouse button by left and right clicking at the same time. \n"
"</p>\n"
"<p align=\"right\">-- Tip contributed by Rafael Beccar</p>\n"
msgstr ""

#: tips.cc:111
